<title>FRANCE: LVMH confirms 1996 profit growth objective.</title>
<headline>LVMH confirms 1996 profit growth objective.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury goods group LVMH said it maintained its objective for sales and profit growth for the full year.</p>
<p>&quot;LVMH maintains its objective for growth in turnover and profit for the year 1996,&quot; the group said in its first-half statement.</p>
<p>It reported a 5.4 percent increase in first-half net attributable profit excluding exceptionals to 1.54 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
